{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A frantic 4 player 3D arena fighting game featuring both versus &amp; beat 'em up co-op adventure modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join the Urban Warriors and brawl against various street gangs, bank robbers, cyberpunks, rogue ninjas, &amp; other foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up &amp; Play Arcade Style Gameplay! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access Status</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 out of 8 Characters with Unique Movesets  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/characterselect2.jpg?t=1739172149\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">7 out of 8 Coop Levels <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/coop_levels2.jpg?t=1739172149\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 out of 8 Versus Levels <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853810/extras/vs_levels2.jpg?t=1739172149\" /></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Player Local Multiplayer </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat \u2018em up Coop Adventure Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Versus Mode </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Arena Fighter </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melee Combos with Launchers, Air Juggles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chargeable Attacks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weapons/Items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tossing &amp; Catching Props </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guard Breaks </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parry &amp; Parry Reversal </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Costumes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throws &amp; Tech Throws</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destructible Props </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_